8. AWS Security Hub

AWS Security Hub provides a centralized view of security findings and security posture across supported AWS services and integrations.

Key Features

* Aggregates findings from supported security services.
* Helps prioritize security issues.
* Supports security posture checks and standards.
* Provides visibility across accounts and regions when configured.
* Integrates with automation and incident-response workflows.

Example

Security findings from GuardDuty, Inspector, and other supported sources can be viewed centrally in Security Hub.

DevOps Use Case

Use Security Hub to consolidate security findings and help teams prioritize issues across cloud environments.

Important: Security Hub centralizes and evaluates findings; it does not replace the underlying detection services.

