14. Amazon Detective

Amazon Detective helps investigate, analyze, and visualize security findings and related activity.

It uses data collected from supported sources to help security teams understand relationships and investigate possible security incidents.

Key Features

* Analyze security-related activity.
* Visualize relationships between entities.
* Help investigate GuardDuty findings.
* Provide context for suspicious activity.
* Support incident investigation.

Example

GuardDuty identifies suspicious activity involving an EC2 instance. Detective can help an investigator explore related activity and understand the broader context.

DevOps Use Case

Use Detective when an alert requires deeper investigation rather than simply sending a notification.

